label "Agent identity and scoped credentials diagram"
box human 14 30 90 40 "human|principal"
box parent 14 106 90 40 "parent agent"
box sub 14 182 90 40 "sub-agent"
box issuer 170 82 130 90 "identity &|credential issuer|(per-agent ID,|short-lived token)" acc
box tokA 350 100 96 26 "scope: task"
box tokB 350 176 96 26 "scope ⊆ parent"
box audit 350 30 96 40 "audit log"
arrow human parent
arrow parent sub
arrow parent issuer
arrow sub issuer
arrow issuer tokA
arrow issuer tokB
arrow issuer audit dashed
note "each hop gets its own narrower credential, not the parent's"
